  "metaDescription": "Government and parliamentary officials address reports suggesting Vice President Gibran Rakabuming Raka may have submitted a resignation letter.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Media reports circulated claims that Vice President Gibran Rakabuming Raka had submitted a resignation letter to President Prabowo Subianto.",
